</button><button class="sound-toggle" type="button" aria-label="Toggle sound" id="sound-toggle" title="Sound (scroll to hear)"><svg aria-hidden="true" viewBox="0 0 24 24" class="sound-toggle__icon sound-toggle__off"><path d="M4 9v6h4l5 4V5L8 9H4z"></path><line x1="17" x2="22" y1="9" y2="14"></line><line x1="22" x2="17" y1="9" y2="14"></line></svg><svg aria-hidden="true" viewBox="0 0 24 24" class="sound-toggle__icon sound-toggle__on"><path d="M4 9v6h4l5 4V5L8 9H4z"></path><path d="M16 8.5a4 4 0 010 7"></path><path d="M18.6 6a7 7 0 010 12"></path></svg></button><main class="v2" dir="ltr"><h1 class="v2-name" tabindex="0" title="Himanshu Maurya"><span class="name-roll slot-text"><span class="char-slot" data-char="ãƒ’"><span class="char-sizer">ãƒ’</span><span class="char-face">ãƒ’</span></span><span class="char-slot" data-char="ãƒ"><span class="char-sizer">ãƒ</span><span class="char-face">ãƒ</span></span><span class="char-slot" data-char="ãƒ³"><span class="char-sizer">ãƒ³</span><span class="char-face">ãƒ³</span></span><span class="char-slot" data-char="ã‚·"><span class="char-sizer">ã‚·</span><span class="char-face">ã‚·</span></span><span class="char-slot" data-char="ãƒ¥"><span class="char-sizer">ãƒ¥</span><span class="char-face">ãƒ¥</span></span><span class="char-slot" data-char="ãƒ»"><span class="char-sizer">ãƒ»</span><span class="char-face">ãƒ»</span></span><span class="char-slot" data-char="ãƒ"><span class="char-sizer">ãƒ</span><span class="char-face">ãƒ</span></span><span class="char-slot" data-char="ã‚¦"><span class="char-sizer">ã‚¦</span><span class="char-face">ã‚¦</span></span><span class="char-slot" data-char="ãƒª"><span class="char-sizer">ãƒª</span><span class="char-face">ãƒª</span></span><span class="char-slot" data-char="ãƒ¤"><span class="char-sizer">ãƒ¤</span><span class="char-face">ãƒ¤</span></span></span><span class="name-native" aria-hidden="true">Himanshu Maurya</span></h1><p class="v2-meta"><span class="v2-updated">Updated 7 Jul 2026</span><span class="v2-status" title="what I'm on right now"><span class="v2-status__dot" aria-hidden="true"></span><span>building urls.bid</span></span></p><figure class="dither-panel" id="dither-panel"><canvas aria-hidden="true" id="dither" width="128" height="38"></canvas><figcaption class="dither-panel__cap">ordered Â· bayer Â· dither</figcaption></figure><div class="v2-prose"><p>I'm a full-stack engineer who ships fast and often. I was CTO at SlaabAI, where I took the real-time voice-AI platform from an empty repo to production. Most of my time now goes to <a href="https://urls.bid" class="basic-link" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">urls.bid</a>, a crypto-native link platform on the x402 micropayment protocol, plus a second product still in <span class="redact" title="revealing soon ğŸ‘€">stealth</span> that I'll reveal soon.</p><p>Out in the open there's <a href="https://github.com/codingstark-dev/bunkill" class="basic-link" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">bunkill</a>, <a href="https://github.com/codingstark-dev/backupmail" class="basic-link" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">backupmail</a>, <a href="https://github.com/codingstark-dev/x402-elysia" class="basic-link" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">x402-elysia</a>, and 290-odd other repos. I'd rather ship something rough and real than polish something no one uses.</p><p>On the side I do security research and bug hunting: made <span class="redact" title="ask me how much Â· DM @codingstark">$$$$<span class="redact__x">!</span></span> in bounties, mostly by quietly telling founding teams what's broken before someone with worse intentions does. Curious how much? <a href="https://x.com/codingstark" class="basic-link" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">DM me</a>. I like hard problems and readable code.</p><p><span class="avail">open to work</span>: full-time, contract, or a gnarly problem worth solving. <a href="mailto:himanshu.indie@gmail.com?subject=Let's%20work%20together" class="hire-link">Hire me</a>, or just say hi on <a href="https://x.com/codingstark" class="basic-link" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">X</a>, <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/codingstark/" class="basic-link" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">LinkedIn</a>, or <a href="mailto:himanshu.indie@gmail.com" class="basic-link">email</a>.</p></div><ul class="v2-stats" aria-label="at a glance"><li><b data-stat="repos" class="slot-text"><span class="char-slot" data-char="2"><span class="char-sizer">2</span><span class="char-face">2</span></span><span class="char-slot" data-char="9"><span class="char-sizer">9</span><span class="char-face">9</span></span><span class="char-slot" data-char="8"><span class="char-sizer">8</span><span class="char-face">8</span></span></b><span>repos</span></li><li><b data-stat="commits" class="slot-text"><span class="char-slot" data-char="~"><span class="char-sizer">~</span><span class="char-face">~</span></span><span class="char-slot" data-char="5"><span class="char-sizer">5</span><span class="char-face">5</span></span><span class="char-slot" data-char="."><span class="char-sizer">.</span><span class="char-face">.</span></span><span class="char-slot" data-char="7"><span class="char-sizer">7</span><span class="char-face">7</span></span><span class="char-slot" data-char="k"><span class="char-sizer">k</span><span class="char-face">k</span></span></b><span>commits</span></li><li><b data-stat="languages" class="slot-text"><span class="char-slot" data-char="1"><span class="char-sizer">1</span><span class="char-face">1</span></span><span class="char-slot" data-char="4"><span class="char-sizer">4</span><span class="char-face">4</span></span><span class="char-slot" data-char="+"><span class="char-sizer">+</span><span class="char-face">+</span></span></b><span>languages</span></li><li><b data-stat="orgs" class="slot-text"><span class="char-slot" data-char="5"><span class="char-sizer">5</span><span class="char-face">5</span></span></b><span>orgs</span></li><li class="v2-stats__live"><span class="live-dot" aria-hidden="true"></span><span>live</span></li></ul><section class="v2-index"><h2>Shipping</h2><div class="v2-index__table"><a href="https://github.com/codingstark-dev/bunkill" class="v2-row v2-row--year-start" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank" style="--row-i:0;--cat:#0891b2"><span class="v2-row__year">2026</span><span class="v2-row__title">bunkill <span class="ship-desc">â€” npkill alternative â€” 2Ã— faster node_modules cleaner</span></span><span class="v2-row__meta">â˜… 35</span></a><a href="https://github.com/codingstark-dev/backupmail" class="v2-row" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank" style="--row-i:1;--cat:#0891b2"><span class="v2-row__year"></span><span class="v2-row__title">backupmail <span class="ship-desc">â€” universal email backup TUI/CLI (Gmail, IMAP, JMAP)</span></span><span class="v2-row__meta">â˜… 13</span></a><a href="https://github.com/codingstark-dev/opencode-dataset-plugin" class="v2-row" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank" style="--row-i:2;--cat:#9333ea"><span class="v2-row__year"></span><span class="v2-row__title">opencode-dataset-plugin <span class="ship-desc">â€” capture agent sessions to a JSONL dataset + OpenTUI reviewer</span></span><span class="v2-row__meta">â˜… 10</span></a><a href="https://github.com/codingstark-dev/mapterminal" class="v2-row" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank" style="--row-i:3;--cat:#0891b2"><span class="v2-row__year"></span><span class="v2-row__title">mapterminal <span class="ship-desc">â€” interactive map viewer in your terminal (Bun)</span></span><span class="v2-row__meta">â˜… 6</span></a><a href="/shipping/" class="v2-row v2-row--more" style="--row-i:4"><span class="v2-row__year"></span><span class="v2-row__title">all 21 projects</span><span class="v2-row__meta">shipping log â†’</span></a></div></section><section class="v2-index v2-exp"><h2>Experience</h2><div class="v2-index__table"><div class="v2-row v2-row--year-start" style="